flowchart TD
    U[User request + authoritative documents] --> P[Planner]
    P --> B[Blueprint / Plan]
    B --> PF[Provider feasibility]
    B --> T[Testability / test design]
    PF --> CF[Coder feasibility]
    T --> CF
    CF -->|feasible| I[Implementation]
    CF -->|plan element infeasible| R[Targeted replan request]
    PF -->|unsupported / incompatible| R
    T -->|untestable / ambiguous| R
    R --> P2[Planner revises affected elements]
    P2 --> A[Revised Engineering Change Package + human reapproval]
    A --> PF
    I --> C[Candidate SHA]
    C --> V[Verification]
    V -->|candidate failure| D[Coder / debugger]
    V -->|environment failure| E[Environment project repair/update]
    E --> V
